{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15301770","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15301770","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1530177001:1":{"text":"He's one of the fiercest Wildborn warriors, and my beloved.","source_cn":"他是雅库伯尔最勇猛的战士之一，也是我的爱人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FCED56AA0DDC48D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1530177002:1":{"text":"When the Herdmaster called us to arms with divine blessing, he was the first to answer the call.","source_cn":"当兽群之主降下加护，号召出征时，他第一时间就站入了战士...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF15573453683352C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530177003:1":{"text":"I'm proud of him. He's the bravest, most loyal warrior of all.","source_cn":"我为他骄傲。他是最勇敢、最忠诚的战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CB2822AEE057F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:兽人翎":{"text":"Plume","source":"兽人翎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}